A_Star(Graph, Start, Goal)

Create a Priority Queue OPEN
Insert Start with priority f(Start)

Create an empty CLOSED set

g(Start) = 0
f(Start) = g(Start) + h(Start)

While OPEN is not empty

    current = Remove node with lowest f value

    If current == Goal
        Return Path

    Add current to CLOSED

    For each neighbour of current

        tentative_g = g(current) + cost(current, neighbour)

        If neighbour is in CLOSED
            Continue

        If neighbour is not in OPEN
            Add neighbour to OPEN

        Else if tentative_g >= g(neighbour)
            Continue

        g(neighbour) = tentative_g
        f(neighbour) = g(neighbour) + h(neighbour)

Return "Path Not Found"